# Incidents And Postmortems

Use incident notes and postmortems for reliability, security, data, or agent-governance failures that should prevent repeat work or repeat mistakes.

## When To Create A Postmortem

- A validation failure escaped a review-fix gate.
- Session state, memory, context, or subagent handoff caused lost work.
- A security or supply-chain issue required remediation.
- A production or user-visible reliability issue occurred.

## Template

Copy `.agent/templates/postmortem.md.tmpl` into this directory with a sortable name such as `2026-05-04-incident-title.md`.

